Alarm scripts
=============

Executable files in this directory are run when an alarm starts ringing:

  alarm-all          every alarm
  alarm-<P><T>       probe P (0-3), type T (L = low, H = high), e.g. alarm-1H

They are run with /bin/sh and receive the same environment variables as the
OpenWrt LinkMeter scripts: al_probe, al_type, al_thresh, al_prep, pn, pcurr,
pn0..pn3, pcurr0..pcurr3, ip and the whole HeaterMeter configuration
(pidp, pidi, ...). A non-zero exit status stops further alarm processing
(email, SMS, push).
